Sunita leads me to the large coffee machine.
That machine is very large.
I had never seen such a machine before.
I look at it with fear.
Sunita smiles.
"Maya, do not worry," she says.
"This is the first step," she says.
She turns a dial.
"This is the second step," she points to the steam wand.
I listen to her instructions carefully.
"Is it safe?" I ask.
"Yes, if you work carefully," Sunita says.
I give my full attention there.
Today I am learning to operate the machine safely.
I am also learning to operate the steam wand properly.
Sunita shows me everything once again.
Now I am ready.
